Package: fugazi.db
Title: Tidy Data from the Fugazi Live Series
Version: 0.1.8
Authors@R: c(
    person("Alex", "Mitrani", , "27974470+alexmitrani@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-1091-7413")),
    person("Dischord Records", role = "cph",
           comment = "copyright holder of the underlying Fugazi Live Series show data - see LICENSE"))
Description: Tidy, corrected reference data documenting the live
    performance history of the band Fugazi: show listings, venue
    coordinates, track durations, and discography metadata. The data is
    sourced primarily from the Fugazi Live Series website maintained by
    Dischord Records (<https://www.dischord.com/fugazi_live_series>), with
    additional discography and duration data from other sources. See the
    LICENSE file for the copyright status of the underlying show data.
